{"c":[{"id":"aaf66fd636a6afaa","sum":"C1: goal segments use leaveFailedToYou: a combobox pick the page reverted goes to Executor.leftToYou and the run goes on (executor/dependents.ts). P3: a cut reader walk keeps unsent prior nodes until a complete walk (model.ts mergeCutWalk).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T021405Z-957fa1314ab52f39","text":"C1: goal segments run with leaveFailedToYou: a combobox pick the page put back (VerbResult restored) and read back unchanged is listed via Executor.leftToYou and the run goes on, skipping a country's state/city/ZIP (executor/dependents.ts). Other callers still stop.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T021729Z-2e26e31d9e56986f","text":"P3: a cut reader walk (root null, stats.truncated) keeps every prior node it did not send until a complete walk (model.ts mergeCutWalk); inferring 'passed' nodes from the old order dropped a text area that a moved node jumped ahead of. Pages are still replaced whole.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f1fda95fcbf10fc8","sum":"P3: attach rows only for hosts with goalFiles (helper.ts filesFor); goalAccept.confirmedFile names the step, fileless rows drop (runs.ts stepMap). A carry lasts until its goal ends (carryOn); pageWalked skips only the document it plans (GoalRuns.carrying).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T021733Z-eb34e4009fe61d9d","text":"P3: page goals get attach rows only for a host with goalFiles (helper.ts filesFor; in process via HelperOptions.goalFiles); goalAccept.confirmedFile names the attach step, and rows given no file are dropped from the run (runs.ts stepMap maps executor steps back to segment steps).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T021750Z-652b23e48a36082a","text":"P3: a carry lives across pages until a carried goal finishes (runs.ts carryOn); GoalRuns.carrying(windowId, doc) is true only for the document a carry plans, so helper.ts pageWalked leaves that page alone and takes any page the carry planned nothing for.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
